[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/320241795","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/3139#issuecomment-320241795","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/3139","id":320241795,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMyMDI0MTc5NQ==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-08-04T12:56:46Z","updated_at":"2017-08-04T12:56:46Z","body":"It looks like the presentation timestamps of the frames in the video file are incorrect. They should be increasingly smoothly by 40000us each frame. The actual values (after decoder re-ordering) are:\r\n```\r\n34364096000\r\n34364136000\r\n34364176000\r\n34364216000\r\n34364256000\r\n34364296000\r\n34364336000\r\n34364376000\r\n34364416000\r\n34364456000\r\n34364496000\r\n34364536000\r\n34364576000\r\n34364616000\r\n34364227000 <-- Incorrect. Should be 34364656000\r\n34364696000\r\n34364736000\r\n34364776000\r\n34364387000 <-- Incorrect. Should be 34364816000\r\n34364856000\r\n34364896000\r\n34364936000\r\n34364547000 <-- Incorrect. Etc.\r\n34365016000\r\n34365056000\r\n34365096000\r\n34364707000 <-- Incorrect.\r\n34365176000\r\n34365216000\r\n34365256000\r\n34364867000 <-- Incorrect.\r\n34365336000\r\n34365376000\r\n34365416000\r\n34365027000 <-- Incorrect.\r\n34365496000\r\n34365536000\r\n34365576000\r\n34365187000 <-- Incorrect.\r\n34365656000\r\n34365696000\r\n34365736000\r\n34365347000 <-- Incorrect.\r\n34365816000\r\n34365856000\r\n34365896000\r\n34365936000\r\n34365976000\r\n34366016000\r\n34366056000\r\n```\r\nNote there are 8 frames (indicated above) where the presentation timestamp appears to jump backward in time by a significant amount. These frames are deemed as being late and so are dropped. The media is bad and should be fixed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/320241795/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1193097961,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTE5MzA5Nzk2MQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/1193097961","actor":{"logi